🔍 1. Security Concepts

Understanding cybersecurity and its importance

Threats, vulnerabilities, and risks

CIA triad: Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability

Types of attacks: malware, phishing, social engineering
🌐 2. Network Security Basics

Network devices and their roles in security

Firewalls, routers, and intrusion detection/prevention

Secure network design principles

Common network threats and mitigation

🧑‍💻 3. Cryptography & Authentication

Basics of encryption and decryption

Symmetric vs asymmetric cryptography

Authentication, authorization, and accounting (AAA)
Password policies and multifactor authentication

🛠️ 4. Cybersecurity Defense Techniques

Endpoint security fundamentals

Patch management and updates

Backups and disaster recovery basics

Security monitoring and logs

📊 5. Security Policies & Best Practices
Organizational security policies

User awareness and training

Data protection and privacy considerations

